BT /F1 9 Tf 50 268 Td (BR-02  |  Core courses \(credits >= 4\) in the same programme-semester cohort require at least) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 255 Td (   one complete calendar day between exams. Cohorts are derived from enrolled students') Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 242 Td (   programme/semester, with course department/semester as a fallback. Holidays count as) Tj ET
