BT /F1 9 Tf 50 592 Td (   constraints are rechecked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 579 Td (BR-10  |  A closed hall is excluded from that session. If the remaining halls cannot fit the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 566 Td (   session, the smallest movable course is placed in a later feasible session and a warning) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 553 Td (   is recorded.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 540 Td (BR-11  |  A late registrant is rejected if the addition creates a clash. Otherwise, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 527 Td (   compatible hall with the most free seats is selected; rejected additions are rolled back.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 514 Td (BR-12  |  Backlog exams are limited to AN in the final three calendar days. Enrolment above) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 50 501 Td (   50 also permits FN in those days.) Tj ET
